# Architecture

- Flow: UI → ViewModel → Repository → Retrofit API (never call APIs from composables)
- Use `UiState` sealed types: `Loading`, `Success`, `Error(message)`
- Repository exposes `suspend` functions; ViewModels use `viewModelScope`
- Pass only IDs through navigation (e.g. `postId`); fetch detail in the detail ViewModel
